'''Season 1: School Days''' (Season1 ～学園生活～, ''Season1 ～Gakuen Seikatsu～'', '''Season1 ~School Life~''') is an event added in the [[Version 11.3 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Season 1: School Days will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many common enemies that the player encounters during main progress.

==Overview==
===About===
Season 1: School Days contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Legendary Love Letters.

